@startuml service_order_budget_approval
title Fluxo dinamico complementar - aprovacao de orcamento e OS
autonumber
actor "Consumidor HTTP" as Caller
participant "Fastify / Zod" as HTTP
participant ApproveBudget as UseCase
participant DrizzleBudgetRepository as BudgetRepo
participant Budget
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant InMemoryEventBus as Bus
participant MoveServiceOrderToApproved as Handler
participant DrizzleServiceOrderRepository as OrderRepo
participant ServiceOrder as Order

Caller -> HTTP: POST /budgets/:budgetId/approve
HTTP -> UseCase: execute({ budgetId })
UseCase -> BudgetRepo: findById(budgetId)
BudgetRepo -> DB: SELECT service_order.budgets
DB --> BudgetRepo: linha do orcamento existente
BudgetRepo --> UseCase: Budget reconstituido
UseCase -> Budget: approve()
Budget -> Budget: status APPROVED; registra BudgetApproved
UseCase -> BudgetRepo: save(budget)
BudgetRepo -> DB: INSERT / UPDATE com verificacao de version
DB --> BudgetRepo: gravacao confirmada
BudgetRepo --> UseCase: save concluido; version incrementada
UseCase -> Budget: pullEvents()
Budget --> UseCase: BudgetApproved
UseCase -> Bus: publish(events)
Bus -> Handler: handle(BudgetApproved)
Handler -> OrderRepo: findById(event.serviceOrderId)
OrderRepo -> DB: SELECT orders LEFT JOIN supply_items
DB --> OrderRepo: agregado persistido
OrderRepo --> Handler: ServiceOrder ou null

alt OS existe e pode transicionar para APPROVED
  Handler -> Order: approve()
  Handler -> OrderRepo: save(serviceOrder)
  OrderRepo -> DB: transacao: grava OS e itens com verificacao de version
  alt versao atual e gravacao bem-sucedida
    DB --> OrderRepo: COMMIT
    OrderRepo --> Handler: save concluido; version incrementada
    Handler --> Bus: conclui
  else conflito de versao ou erro de persistencia
    DB --> OrderRepo: nenhuma linha atualizada ou erro
    OrderRepo -> DB: ROLLBACK da transacao da OS
    OrderRepo --> Handler: ConcurrentModificationError ou erro de persistencia
    Handler --> Bus: falha do handler
    Bus -> Bus: registra event handler failed; sem retry
  end
else OS existe e nao pode transicionar para APPROVED
  Handler --> Bus: retorna sem alterar OS (idempotencia)
else OS nao encontrada
  Handler --> Bus: ServiceOrderNotFoundError
  Bus -> Bus: registra falha do handler
end

Bus --> UseCase: publish resolvido
UseCase --> HTTP: dados do Budget aprovado
HTTP --> Caller: HTTP 200

note over BudgetRepo,OrderRepo
  Caminho principal assume payload valido e orcamento PENDING existente.
  Falhas de persistencia do caso de uso sao mapeadas pelo error handler.
  Budget e OS sao salvos separadamente, sem transacao conjunta.
  Qualquer falha do handler (inclusive concorrencia) e registrada pelo bus;
  ela nao desfaz o Budget e nao impede o HTTP 200 da aprovacao.
end note
@enduml
